  "details": "As the title already tells, a quick toggle on when to let other people clone your avatar and when they shouldn’t would be a huge help and QoL improvement. there are a lot of active users who aren’t in favor of the cloning feature as they have their own sets of avatars and sometimes even just private shared ones. But sometimes you want to share your avatar with a friend! so either a quick toggle to turn on and off the cloning or even a toggle for specifically allow certain other users or even ranks to clone your avatar would be a great idea!",
